  <
  Charlie Kirk New >
  New Contact Name
  Charlie Kirk
  Exactly.
  Update
  X
  Can't wait to see you in person and tell
  you what's going on behind the scenes. I
  just cannot let what happened fly. I have
  taken the high road too many times on
  Ben's public emotions. It's stunning to
  me they he is 40 and behaves like this.
  I can't wait to hear. He's losing a lot of
  support.
  Yeah. Unbelievable bad for him from a
  PR stance. I've expressed that I think he
  needs to take a week off. I think he's in
  some sort of a psychosis. Genuinely
  He has fewer and fewer allies. Also I wish
  he got this worked up about America.
  Weird.
  The Israel First thing is something 1
  cannot comprehend. AIPAC going after
  Thomas Massie was a major wake up call
  for me. Cannot have foreign interest
  groups going after our congressmen.
  Nov 17, 2023 at 1:15 PM
  +
  Text Message • SMS
